  "scope": "Node native LWW projection + binary query bridge + decoded JS results. No crypto, OPFS, RPC, network, module startup or checkpoint/restore time is included in query timers. Restore resets caches between cold samples. Rare equality returns the same COMPLETE result as a full bounded scan; typed descending numeric range returns 100 rows. Edit timing includes single-command encoding/application and incremental maintenance of two indexes. First query after a small edit remains warm. Twenty alternating edits and exact-result queries per iteration verify maintained caches; reference snapshots and assertions are outside the measured intervals. Sorted vectors can still move O(n) references when a key changes; this is not logarithmic write performance.",
